  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hablando con los chefs de la ciudad, muchas\nveces sale tu nombre en la conversación...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n¿Hay algo que debería saber de ti, Giso?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No soy más que un pícaro cualquiera que creció\nen esta ciudad.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200073006F00790020006D00E10073002000710075006500200075006E0020007000ED006300610072006F0020006300750061006C007100750069006500720061002000710075006500200063007200650063006900F3000A0065006E002000650073007400610020006300690075006400610064002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Una vez conocí a un chef que se desvivía tratando\nde hacer más sabrosos los platos, pese a su fugaz<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nexistencia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Su devoción por la gastronomía me inspiró.\nEso es todo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300750020006400650076006F0063006900F3006E00200070006F00720020006C0061002000670061007300740072006F006E006F006D00ED00610020006D006500200069006E007300700069007200F3002E000A00450073006F00200065007300200074006F0064006F002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aunque veo que no soy el único con altos\nestándares.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTanto la cocción del cruasán como la cantidad\nde sal son perfectas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La cocina es una ciencia exacta. Si sigues\nlas medidas e instrucciones, no puede salir mal.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Además, he entrenado a mis Pokémon para que\najusten la temperatura de sus movimientos de<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntipo Fuego con gran precisión, grado por grado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Increíble! Con ese talento, no me extraña que\nseas un Entrenador de renombre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Así es! Mi equipo y yo sabemos dejar al rival\nen su punto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007300ED00200065007300210020004D0069002000650071007500690070006F0020007900200079006F00200073006100620065006D006F0073002000640065006A0061007200200061006C00200072006900760061006C000A0065006E002000730075002000700075006E0074006F002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mira que sois especialitos con esto de la comida.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006900720061002000710075006500200073006F0069007300200065007300700065006300690061006C00690074006F007300200063006F006E0020006500730074006F0020006400650020006C006100200063006F006D006900640061002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cualquier cosa está rica después de un largo día\nde trabajo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300750061006C0071007500690065007200200063006F00730061002000650073007400E10020007200690063006100200064006500730070007500E9007300200064006500200075006E0020006C006100720067006F0020006400ED0061000A00640065002000740072006100620061006A006F002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Grisela! ¿Lucharás a mi lado?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100470072006900730065006C00610021002000BF004C0075006300680061007200E10073002000610020006D00690020006C00610064006F003F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Está bien. Después de un combate, también sabe\ntodo mejor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E10020006200690065006E002E00200044006500730070007500E9007300200064006500200075006E00200063006F006D0062006100740065002C002000740061006D0062006900E9006E00200073006100620065000A0074006F0064006F0020006D0065006A006F0072002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En ese caso, necesitaré tu ayuda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00200065007300650020006300610073006F002C0020006E0065006300650073006900740061007200E9002000740075002000610079007500640061002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por supuesto",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F007200200073007500700075006500730074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te esperamos en la arena.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400650020006500730070006500720061006D006F007300200065006E0020006C00610020006100720065006E0061002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Va a ser un combate de lo más reñido.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100200061002000730065007200200075006E00200063006F006D00620061007400650020006400650020006C006F0020006D00E1007300200072006500F100690064006F002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Quiero mostrarle a Giso mi admiración con\nun combate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100510075006900650072006F0020006D006F00730074007200610072006C0065002000610020004700690073006F0020006D0069002000610064006D0069007200610063006900F3006E00200063006F006E000A0075006E00200063006F006D0062006100740065002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Venga, hazlo por Grisel, a ver si así se calla.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560065006E00670061002C002000680061007A006C006F00200070006F0072002000470072006900730065006C002C00200061002000760065007200200073006900200061007300ED002000730065002000630061006C006C0061002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos a ganar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F007300200061002000670061006E0061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La sangre me hierve de tal manera que me\nhace arder por dentro, ¡vamos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mi compañero os calcinará con sus oscuras\nllamas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D006900200063006F006D0070006100F100650072006F0020006F0073002000630061006C00630069006E0061007200E100200063006F006E00200073007500730020006F007300630075007200610073000A006C006C0061006D00610073002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Date prisa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10044006100740065002000700072006900730061002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Os reduciré a cenizas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004F00730020007200650064007500630069007200E900200061002000630065006E0069007A00610073002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias por tu ayuda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061006300690061007300200070006F0072002000740075002000610079007500640061002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Charizard, megaevoluciona y que tus llamas\ndevoren y deslumbren a todos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El nombre de nuestro grupo significa cambio y\nvida nueva. ¡Como la megaevolución!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cuento contigo, Skarmory! ¡Ayúdame a proteger\nla reputación del clan!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He perdido, pero al menos he podido mostrarle\na Giso mi ardiente ambición.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La llama del cocinero que arde en mi interior\nes más grande que nunca.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, sí, lo que tú digas.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nToma esto como agradecimiento.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300ED002C0020007300ED002C0020006C006F00200071007500650020007400FA002000640069006700610073002E00100001BE01000A0054006F006D00610020006500730074006F00200063006F006D006F002000610067007200610064006500630069006D00690065006E0074006F002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Has recibido la Camisa de barista de Grisel\nde color alternativo.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061007300200072006500630069006200690064006F0020006C0061002000430061006D00690073006100200064006500200062006100720069007300740061002000640065002000470072006900730065006C000A0064006500200063006F006C006F007200200061006C007400650072006E0061007400690076006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te iría bien un peinado como el de Grisel.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006500200069007200ED00610020006200690065006E00200075006E0020007000650069006E00610064006F00200063006F006D006F00200065006C002000640065002000470072006900730065006C002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los buenos encuentros como este nos guían en\nla dirección correcta...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F00730020006200750065006E006F007300200065006E006300750065006E00740072006F007300200063006F006D006F002000650073007400650020006E006F007300200067007500ED0061006E00200065006E000A006C00610020006400690072006500630063006900F3006E00200063006F007200720065006300740061002E002E002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Seré el mejor cocinero y el mejor Entrenador!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530065007200E900200065006C0020006D0065006A006F007200200063006F00630069006E00650072006F0020007900200065006C0020006D0065006A006F007200200045006E007400720065006E00610064006F0072002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Después de un combate así, me comería\ncualquier cosa...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006500730070007500E9007300200064006500200075006E00200063006F006D006200610074006500200061007300ED002C0020006D006500200063006F006D0065007200ED0061000A006300750061006C0071007500690065007200200063006F00730061002E002E002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "\"Como, luego existo\". Es mi nuevo lema.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00220043006F006D006F002C0020006C007500650067006F002000650078006900730074006F0022002E0020004500730020006D00690020006E007500650076006F0020006C0065006D0061002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    }
